{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3402","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3402","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3402\",\"parent_revision\":\"0e4d08f63b049b0d68335acca4969b5b1256c656b06849d1d8881468dc5a4652\",\"root_revision\":\"0e4d08f63b049b0d68335acca4969b5b1256c656b06849d1d8881468dc5a4652\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-09-04\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`ContentTaskProvider.claim_task` in `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/backends/content.py` (~184-198) swallows a genuine `ContentConflictError` (an optimistic-concurrency conflict raised when multiple agents write the same shared plan content concurrently) into a plain `False` return. `dh_core/operations.py` (~959-971) then reports this as `\\\"Task is 'X', not 'not-started'\\\"` \u2014 a status-mismatch message \u2014 even when the task is genuinely still `not-started` and the real cause was a concurrent-write race, not a status conflict.\\n\\nReproduction (from the reporting agent): claiming task T4 on a plan with multiple concurrently-active sibling tasks (T1-T3 running in parallel on the same plan under `dh:multi-perspective-review`) returned `claimed:false` with the misleading status message on the first two attempts, while `sam_task(read)` and the CLI `plan claim` both independently confirmed the task was actually still `not-started`. A third attempt succeeded once the concurrent writers quieted.\\n\\nImpact: a caller that takes the warning at face value (rather than retrying) could wrongly conclude the task is unavailable/already claimed and abandon it, when the correct action is a simple retry.\\n\\nUser-provided context: the fix likely belongs in `claim_task`'s exception handling \u2014 a caught `ContentConflictError` should be surfaced distinctly from an actual status mismatch (e.g. a retry-signaling return value or a distinguishable exception/error message), rather than collapsed into the same `False`/generic-message path. Exact contract is design work for grooming.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Discovered incidentally during dh:multi-perspective-review T4 (accessibility) dispatch for #3182's quality gate\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-04\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"f36213aff339595d15ad10bb7ae8a43fabe2d3aeeb7d995d2cf68a55f3dde8f7\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABStoxHw\"}"}